# NFS Exports Configuration
# This file defines what directories are exported via NFS
# Format: <directory> <host>(<options>)

# Main export directory for SeaweedFS and other services
# Allows read-write access to all clients in the network
/nfs-share  *(rw,sync,no_subtree_check,no_root_squash,fsid=0)

# Alternative: Restrict to specific network (more secure)
# /nfs-share  172.30.0.0/16(rw,sync,no_subtree_check,no_root_squash,fsid=0)

# Note:
# - rw: read-write access
# - sync: synchronous writes (safer, slightly slower)
# - no_subtree_check: improves performance
# - no_root_squash: allows root access (needed for Docker containers)
# - fsid=0: required for NFSv4 root export
